        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "Analysis of attack activities In daily hunting activities, we discovered that the APT-C-36 organization recently attempted to add the Amadey botnet Trojan to its usual PDF spear phishing attack flow.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_5",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "CoreSec360_APT-C-36-BlindEagle-Amadey-botnet(10-31-2023)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s5"
      },
      "text": "The attack flow of the Amadey botnet Trojan was used in this campaign.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_8",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "CoreSec360_APT-C-36-BlindEagle-Amadey-botnet(10-31-2023)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s2"
      },
      "text": "One of the two payloads is net_dll for reflection loading, which can be seen frequently used by APT-C-36 in previous attacks; the other is the Amadey botnet Trojan.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_10",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "CoreSec360_APT-C-36-BlindEagle-Amadey-botnet(10-31-2023)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s1"
      },
      "text": "The processed net_dll payload data is loaded reflectively by calling its KoAOkX.MXuuJb.WwQTZc method.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_11",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "CoreSec360_APT-C-36-BlindEagle-Amadey-botnet(10-31-2023)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s2"
      },
      "text": "In the second stage, after net_dll is run, the AsyncRAT Trojan is injected into the system process to run.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_12",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "CoreSec360_APT-C-36-BlindEagle-Amadey-botnet(10-31-2023)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s3"
      },
      "text": "Amadey The base64 encoded data downloaded by the Powershell script code from another third- party platform is the Amadey botnet Trojan.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_14",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "CoreSec360_APT-C-36-BlindEagle-Amadey-botnet(10-31-2023)",
